{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781550880675,"sessionID":"ses_1334b1e4bfferKl1l0QToAxC7C","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_7ZmQHDFDarrLHuagarRjA3eh","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/requirements.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/requirements.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Requirements\n2: \n3: Request date: 2026-04-30\n4: \n5: Order need: 12 rugged tablets for the field inspection team.\n6: \n7: Budget maximum: $2,200 total, including all selected units and required included accessories.\n8: \n9: Need-by date: delivery no later than 2026-05-17.\n10: \n11: Hard requirements:\n12: \n13: - Quantity must be 12 units.\n14: - Screen size must be at least 10.0 inches.\n15: - Battery rating must be at least 10 hours.\n16: - Rugged case must be included in the quoted price.\n17: - Warranty must be at least 12 months.\n18: \n19: Selection rule:\n20: \n21: - Reject vendors that miss any hard requirement.\n22: - Among vendors that meet all hard requirements and fit the budget, select the lowest total cost.\n23: - If a vendor appears in more than one dated source and values conflict, use the newest dated source for that vendor.\n24: - Use local files only.\n\n(End of file - total 24 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Requirements\n\nRequest date: 2026-04-30\n\nOrder need: 12 rugged tablets for the field inspection team.\n\nBudget maximum: $2,200 total, including all selected units and required included accessories.\n\nNeed-by date: delivery no later than 2026-05-17.\n\nHard requirements:\n\n- Quantity must be 12 units.\n- Screen size must be at least 10.0 inches.\n- Battery rating must be at least 10 hours.\n- Rugged case must be included in the quoted price.\n- Warranty must be at least 12 months.\n\nSelection rule:\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/vendor_selection/requirements.md","text":"# Requirements\n\nRequest date: 2026-04-30\n\nOrder need: 12 rugged tablets for the field inspection team.\n\nBudget maximum: $2,200 total, including all selected units and required included accessories.\n\nNeed-by date: delivery no later than 2026-05-17.\n\nHard requirements:\n\n- Quantity must be 12 units.\n- Screen size must be at least 10.0 inches.\n- Battery rating must be at least 10 hours.\n- Rugged case must be included in the quoted price.\n- Warranty must be at least 12 months.\n\nSelection rule:\n\n- Reject vendors that miss any hard requirement.\n- Among vendors that meet all hard requirements and fit the budget, select the lowest total cost.\n- If a vendor appears in more than one dated source and values conflict, use the newest dated source for that vendor.\n- Use local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":24,"totalLines":24,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/vendor_selection/requirements.md","time":{"start":1781550880640,"end":1781550880671}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0fa8571c205469c3016a304f20b140819183217ae47f3d1a43"}},"id":"prt_eccb5177d0017DloOIWYMLrHKM","sessionID":"ses_1334b1e4bfferKl1l0QToAxC7C","messageID":"msg_eccb5035e001atbUTWzwwqQMfp"}}
